## 运行命令

```bash
docker compose up -d
.venv/bin/python3.14 -m pytest test/eval/scorers_test.py -v
.venv/bin/python3.14 test/eval/run_eval.py
.venv/bin/python3.14 -m pytest server/api/agent_test.py -v
```

## 验收标准

- [ ] `LANGSMITH_TRACING=true` 时 LangGraph 自动上报（需 `.env` 配 Key）；无需 invoke_v3
- [ ] `scorers_test.py` 全绿
- [ ] `run_eval.py` 输出工具/回复评分报告
- [ ] `docs/knowledge/M11-eval-langsmith.md` 存在且 README 索引为 done
